openrouter.ai	Intel::DOMAIN	threatdefence-cybermes	Cybermes low: Model API reached by hackingBuddyGPT with the shipped .env.example model openrouter/anthropic/claude-3.5-sonnet (.env.example:13); also the documented default api_base. A public service many tools use, so only context (hackingBuddyGPT operators)	https://github.com/ipa-lab/hackingBuddyGPT/blob/e23d918592556f71b8e3b2ee152449e82fa14794/.env.example#L13-L19
Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) Cybermes/2.1 (Recon Crawler)	Intel::SOFTWARE	threatdefence-cybermes	Cybermes high: User agent of the cybermes_recon_crawl MCP tool's native Go crawler (up to 30 pages, links and API paths from HTML and JS), used when katana is not installed or prefer_katana is false (pkg/crawl/crawler.go:84,274). A custom User-Agent header from the tool call overrides it (Cybermes operators)	https://github.com/Zyrexnn/Cybermes/blob/149b9a66752244bbb78926dcdc94dfc5b647ed80/pkg/crawl/crawler.go#L84
Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) Cybermes/2.1 (Security Assessment)	Intel::SOFTWARE	threatdefence-cybermes	Cybermes high: User agent of the cybermes_http_probe MCP tool's native Go probe (one GET, title, server and technology detection), used when httpx is not installed (pkg/probe/probe.go:82,133) (Cybermes operators)	https://github.com/Zyrexnn/Cybermes/blob/149b9a66752244bbb78926dcdc94dfc5b647ed80/pkg/probe/probe.go#L82
Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) Cybermes/3.2 (API Fuzzer)	Intel::SOFTWARE	threatdefence-cybermes	Cybermes high: User agent of the cybermes_fuzz_endpoints MCP tool's native Go fuzzer (5 workers, tools/wordlists/common.txt or 41 built-in paths such as .env, .git/config, actuator, swagger), used when ffuf is not installed (pkg/fuzz/fuzzer.go:58-65,382). The tool is auto-approved in the npm launcher's default settings (Cybermes operators)	https://github.com/Zyrexnn/Cybermes/blob/149b9a66752244bbb78926dcdc94dfc5b647ed80/pkg/fuzz/fuzzer.go#L382
Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) Cybermes/3.2 (Subdomain Recon)	Intel::SOFTWARE	threatdefence-cybermes	Cybermes high: User agent of the cybermes_subdomain_discovery MCP tool's query to https://crt.sh/?q=%25.<domain>&output=json when subfinder is missing or fails (pkg/subdomain/subdomain.go:170,183). HTTPS: visible only with TLS inspection (Cybermes operators)	https://github.com/Zyrexnn/Cybermes/blob/149b9a66752244bbb78926dcdc94dfc5b647ed80/pkg/subdomain/subdomain.go#L183
